      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I am not sure if the region start is different for arm technologies?\n\nI wouldn\u0027t expect so, since `z_interrupt_stacks` sounds generic. Are you sure `CONFIG_HW_STACK_PROTECTION` is enabled for our ARM boards? Maybe ARM is not set up to guard the IRQ stack (only the main stack: `z_main_stack`)? \n\nAlso, let\u0027s upstream this test (and the null pointer test, and any others that we\u0027ve written that are generic Zephyr). We can run upstream tests in [like this](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/test/run_device_tests.py;l\u003d887-926;drc\u003d39782171697eb70b15109137e51b1ac8781ee0a8).",
